{"title":"1988 OIM Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider expressions in the form: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/1/501f39116d1ee2b5d3d5d0e4f102e14d780d8d75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+yt+zt^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> rational numbers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/b/c6babe4ccbfd9b3eefd6d21fc75436250eac9da4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^3=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15df60c7333e41cc0a2a5851b348881b23814cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+yt+zt^2 \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" />, then there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f23bf124b6b2b2a993eb313c72e678664ac74a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$v$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> as rational numbers such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c7243d4e1ddb2b3415825a692eedec348be5243f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x + yt + z^2)(u + vt + wt^2) = 1\\]\" width=\"245\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe3.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe3.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017062647\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1750/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.512      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.512      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26054:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017062647 and revision id 207018. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}